oo  following robin and her sexy body parts  we have mr 3  and his dorudoru aka waxwax fruit he is  pretty much a candle human  this ability lets him create and control  a lot of wax and it even produces a  flame on top of his head  as if he were really a candle unlike a  logia user mr 3 cannot turn his whole  body into wax  the wax can be molded as the user wishes  the wax will solidify and become as  strong as steel  obviously because it's wax this power  does not play well with fire  after the candle human we got tin plate  waffle  the former monarch of the drum kingdom  he possesses the baku baku no me  aka the munch munch fruit this fruit  lets its user become an eating machine  the munch munch fruit user can open  their mouth extremely wide and eat  things that would not normally be  possible for humans to eat  even toxic things this dude is an actual  sword eater  no magic trick involved and he can even  eat cannons and houses  he can also manifest the things he eats  in creative ways for instance he can  even turn his body into a fortress that  shoots cannons  although he's often used for comedic  effect wapol's abilities are definitely  powerful the only problem is he  constantly has the munchies  after the ultimate eater we have bentham  of the wild aka mr two bunkurei  and his money money aka clone clone  fruit even though they started out as  enemies  bentham and luffy have since become  friends  not only that bentham has proven to be  an insanely good friend he  sacrificed himself repeatedly for luffy  including an  impel down which was touching af the  user of the clone clone fruit can  perfectly copy someone's face and body  after they touch that person's face with  their right hand  the user's clothes don't change though  so that could give them away  this ability is great if you want to  trick people into thinking you are  someone else  but it is not very useful in a  one-on-one fight before bentham  kurozumi higurashi a major supporter of  orochi  